      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The effect of Voltarol, administered routinely, in reducing the postoperative requirement for opioid drugs was monitored using patient-controlled analgesia. Omnopon consumption was recorded together with pain scores. The significance of the results is discussed with reference to the dosage and timing of analgesia and to nursing practice."},
